OL,3,GNEWSAPolice issue interview letters as
OL,4,Apart of Garvaghy Road investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have said they will begin
OL,7,Fissuing letters regarding an interview
OL,8,Fprocess to people "reasonably
OL,9,Fsuspected" of committing offences
OL,10,Flinked to the unlawful protests
OL,11,Fblocking the Garvaghy Road in
OL,12,FPortadown.
OL,14,FA statement issued on Thursday said
OL,15,Fpolice were moving to the next phase of
OL,16,Ftheir investigation in connection with
OL,17,Fthe Drumcree dispute.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
