OL,3,GNEWSAPolice issue interview letters as
OL,4,Apart of Garvaghy Road investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnionist politicians have called for
OL,7,Fthe police to take action against First
OL,8,FMinister Michelle O'Neill and other
OL,9,Fsenior Sinn Fein politicians who took
OL,10,Fpart in the protest against the Orange
OL,11,FOrder march.
OL,13,FA Sinn Fein spokesperson said "a number
OL,14,Fof representatives and party members
OL,15,Fhave received correspondence from the
OL,16,FPSNI" in relation to the issue.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
